@title Issues: the row of a chosen problem has a soft highlight (run with KOPERCAD_MOTION=hold; still under the harness)
@area Reports
# Open the Issues list from the status pill, pin the panel (an unpinned panel closes on a click), choose a problem. With KOPERCAD_MOTION=hold the highlight is frozen at 0.3 s; under the harness default no highlight is drawn.
open qa/fixtures/door-cutouts.novo
wait 20
click_text "8 warnings"
wait 10
click 233 69
wait 5
shot list
click 120 220
wait 10
shot chosen
check_layout
